                                                "sense_id": "596cd7c7-34b3-3f45-8613-7d3ef958d938",
                                                "text": "Hair had appeared in greater quantities where I didnʼt want it, and I couldnʼt keep up with the demands of depilation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f422c70a-d024-3b1c-bb33-bce51f2dda29",
